- **Reflection.md** → Notes on what I learned, challenges, and outcomes.

---

## Conclusion
Unit 2 represents the transition from basic Kotlin programming to interactive app concepts.  
It combines language fundamentals with user interaction and state management, preparing me for more advanced topics in Unit 3 (Form Handling & Data Storage) and Unit 4 (Lifecycle Awareness).
